m-._NV?xuRjjYbH-;ogMxM{","description":"I was at the Copenhagen Zoo that day walking by the aquarium looking for this bear (I’d never seen one before). It wasn’t where it was supposed to be and I was about to leave thinking that it was sleeping or something and somehow it appeared above me standing on the crystal of the aquarium tunnel. I fell instantly in love with the perspective that I had and pick up my phone quickly  and took some shots before it moved. I’m glad I thought fast because it was there just for like 5-6 seconds. It made me feel very happy for the moment I was living. Sorry for my unperfect english, I’m mexican haha.","alt_description":"polar bear on body of water","breadcrumbs":[],"urls":{"raw":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504599787388-de6cd17b7659?ixlib=rb-4.1.0","full":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504599787388-de6cd17b7659?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb","regular":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504599787388-de6cd17b7659?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&w=1080&fit=max","small":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504599787388-de6cd17b7659?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&w=400&fit=max","thumb":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504599787388-de6cd17b7659?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&w=200&fit=max","small_s3":"https://s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images.unsplash.com/small/photo-1504599787388-de6cd17b7659"},"links":{"self":"https://api.unsplash.com/photos/polar-bear-on-body-of-water-c2WnkX7-1K4","html":"https://unsplash.com/photos/polar-bear-on-body-of-water-c2WnkX7-1K4","download":"https://unsplash.com/photos/c2WnkX7-1K4/download","download_location":"https://api.unsplash.com/photos/c2WnkX7-1K4/download"},"likes":1076,"liked_by_user":false,"bookmarked":false,"current_user_collections":[],"sponsorship":null,"topic_submissions":{"animals":{"status":"approved","approved_on":"2020-04-06T14:20:17Z"},"experimental":{"status":"approved","approved_on":"2020-04-06T1